Subject: Select original shadow layers, volume blend and projection scheduling
Upstream-base: c7b2e663f878d38dc429ab12ee7db451daf0c217

Extract original cameras, eleven atlas partitions, update scheduling and shadow
projection setup while leaving full game scene and character drawing unlinked.
Select four original layer descriptions with explicit native ownership and
rollback. Use active EFB dimensions for the original volume target/blend pass.

